Stop [E3010]: `Divided by zero` — with Jet file and line.
  --> u8_divide_zero.jet:5
 Why: the operands or position do not produce a valid result, so the safe runtime stops instead of returning corrupted data.
 Fix: check the operands or bounds before the operation, or use a checked operation that returns an outcome.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3010
